    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isaaka abiita Yakobo chikhabi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Isaaka akofula, aabofula chimoni. Nio alaanga Esau, omwana wewe omubele, mala aloma ali, “Mwana wase!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esau afukiilila ali, “Paapa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amuboolela ali, “Ese nakofuule, se manya endaalo eye lifwa liase tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono banula bulwaani bwowo, situukhu sie buembo ne buyiingo oche mu lukoongo oaaye esaang'i wire, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mala wiche undeekhele siakhulia silayi nisio nasiima undeerere ndie nio khubiite chikhabi ne ekhafwa tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nga Isaaka ne aboolelanga Esau, Rabeka aaba arekeeresie. Nio oli Esau arekukha acha mu lukoongo khuaaya chisaang'i, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabeka aboolela Yakobo ali, “Nama khuulila raraao aboolela wandaayo Esau ali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Cha oaye esaang'i mala undeekhele siakhulia nisio nasiima, ndie, khubiite chikhabi mumoni cha Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi ne ekhafwa tawe.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono khwako, mwana wase, ndekeeresie mala okhole nga khulaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cha mu munyele mala undeerere chimbusi chimeeme chibili ndekhele raraao siakhulia silayi nisio asiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala omuyilile alie, nio akhubiite chikhabi ne akhafwa tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Yakobo aboolela maawe ali, “Wandaayase Esau ali omundu owe kamaswa ne ese ndi omumiuufu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakana paapa akhola ario ambabaasia mala nabonekhana omubeeyi, mala nireerere silaamo, chilekhe khuba chikhabi tawe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maawe amuboolela ali, “Mwana wase silaamo siowo sibe khwise, ne kakhali nenya orie likhuwa liase mala oche undeerere chimeeme.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio acha achireerera maawe mala ang'oona siakhulia silayi nisio raraawe asiima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rabeka abukula chingubo cha Esau chindayi nicho aaba nacho munju mwewe mala achifwara Yakobo, omwana wewe omukeekhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio amufuuma bisieelo bie chimeeme khu makhono ne mwikosi mwewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arusia siakhulia silayi ne kumukaati nikwo aaba ne ang'oonile mala aelesia omwana wewe Yakobo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nio Yakobo acha munju nimwo raraawe aaba mala alaanga ali, “Paapa!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akobosia ali, “Ee, ewe naanu mwana wase?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo akobosia raraawe ali, “Ese ndi Esau omwana wowo omubele. Nakholile nga umbooleele. Nosiima yinyokha wikhale, olie enyama eye esaang'i niyo embaayile mala umbiite chikhabi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Isaaka amureeba ali, “Mwana wase, okinyoolile khangu oriena?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amukobosia ali, “Sikila Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi Wele wowo ambelesie bukhili.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka aloma Yakobo ali, “yiicha siimbi ano, khuabaasie, manye ng'ali ne oli omwana wase Esau namwe tawe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yakobo eseenda siimbi niio Isaaka raraawe aaba, amuabaasia mala aloma ali, “Kumumilo kuli kwa Yakobo ne kamakhono kali ka Esau.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mala khumumanyilisia tawe, sikila kamakhono kewe kaba ne kamaswa nga ka wandaaye Esau, nio amubiita chikhabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amureeba ali, “Ng'ali ewe oli omwana wase Esau?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
