              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Esau aaloma ali, “Se bamutiuukha bali Yakobo mu bung'ali! Luno lukhola khabili ne eyisia mu bweyaangu bwase. Aabukula kumukabwa kwase kwe khuuba omwana omubele ne luno ambukuule chikhabi chase.” Aareeba raraawe ali, “Se undekheelekho ese ekhabi tawe?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.36"
            ]
          }
        }
