          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isaaka aakobosia Esau ali, “Namukholile abe omwami khwiwe, lundi namuele bawandaaye bewe boosi babe bakholi bewe. Namuele bikeswa ne ndali. Nono ewe mwana wase khukholela siina?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
