          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne kakhali Rabeka aulila kamakhuwa ka Esau, omwana wewe omukhulu. Arumania alaanga Yakobo, omwana wewe omuro, mala amuboolela ali, “Wandaayo Esau alikho eoleelesia ne lilibaasia lie khukhwiira ewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 27:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nono khwako, mwana wase, mbulile, yinyokha, wilukhile wa wandaayase Labani mu Harani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.27.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.27.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
